      <header class="hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">Cat care basics</p>
        <h1>Frequently asked cat questions</h1>
        <p class="intro">
          Quick answers for curious cat people, from everyday behavior to simple
          care habits that help cats feel safe, healthy, and understood.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="faq-list" aria-label="Cat questions and answers">
