          <div class="details" id="answer-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="question-5" hidden>
            <p>
              A comfortable cat may have relaxed ears, soft eyes, a loose body,
              slow blinks, and a gently curved or upright tail. Give cats space if
              they flatten their ears, tuck their body, hiss, or try to leave.
            </p>
